        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Camp, Maggie Kiley, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, Amelia Rose Blaire\n- Films: Pitch Perfect, Pitch Perfect 2, Pitch Perfect 3, Caught\n- Organizations: Barden University, The Bellas\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Camp played Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect\" released in 2012.\n- \"Pitch Perfect 2\" is a film released in 2015.\n- \"Pitch Perfect 2\" centers on the fictional Barden University and The Bellas, an all-female a cappella singing group.\n- \"Caught\" is a 2015 American psychological thriller film directed by Maggie Kiley.\n- \"Caught\" stars Anna Camp, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, and Amelia Rose Blaire.\n- Anna Camp played Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect 2\" released in 2015.\n- Anna Camp was identified as appearing in the upcoming film \"Pitch Perfect 3\" scheduled for 2017.",
